<title>USA: Culligan Water Q1 April 30 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Culligan Water Q1 April 30 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   April 30,</p>
<p>							    1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net sales					    $99,403   $83,390</p>
<p>   Gross profit					45,049    36,738</p>
<p> SGA expenses					  30,251    25,814</p>
<p>   Operating income				  14,084     1,205</p>
<p> Interest, net					  (823)     (923)</p>
<p>Gain from disposition of investment in Anvil**</p>
<p>							   31,098	  --</p>
<p>Income before income taxes, minority interest</p>
<p>   and extraordinary item			  44,983	 518</p>
<p> Income Taxes					  17,855     3,866</p>
<p> Minority Interest					114	  --</p>
<p>   Income (loss) before extraordinary item   27,014   (3,348)</p>
<p> Extraordinary item for write-off		 (422)	  --</p>
<p>   Net income (loss)				 26,592   (3,348)</p>
<p>Income (loss) per share:</p>
<p>   Income (loss) before extraordinary item     1.22    (0.17)</p>
<p>   Extraordinary item				(0.02)	0.00</p>
<p>   Net income (loss) per share		     1.20    (0.17)</p>
<p>   Weighted average shares outstanding***    22,123    19,914</p>
<p>Impact of fair value adjustments attributable</p>
<p>to the reorganization of former parent:</p>
<p>Impact on net income of reorganization</p>
<p>   amortization					   n/a   (9,330)</p>
<p> Impact on earnings per share			 n/a    (0.47)</p>
<p>**  On March 15, 1997, the Company disposed of its investment in Anvil Holdings Inc for $50,897, including the repayment of outstanding accrued interest and dividends. The impact on earnings, net of related tax, was $18,895, or $.85 per share, for the three month period ended April 30, 1997.</p>
<p>*** Weighted average shares outstanding for the three month period ended April 30, 1996 excludes the effect of stock options.  Had they been included, the shares outstanding would have been increased by 1,137 shares.</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Culligan Water Technologies Inc</p>
